{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1230736-why-can-t-ww-op-or-someone-make-a-subscription-site-like-the-reference-desk","id":1230736,"title":"Why can't WW, OP, or SOMEONE make a subscription site like The Reference Desk","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-27T20:54:37-07:00","id":1230736,"title":"Why can't WW, OP, or SOMEONE make a subscription site like The Reference Desk","content":"I'm not saying that anyone should start another website like the Reference Desk, because that would break the law, and breaking the law is always and without exception a Very Bad Thing\u2122.<br /> <br /> However, and setting aside the inarguable immorality of content piracy and copyright infringement--I've heard it told by <i>people</i> in <i>places</i> (cause I never used it or looked at it, cause that would be wrong and wrong things are bad) that the manner in which information was arranged on that particular website was of great use to many. In other words, from what I hear, it was quite functional and good at performing the function it sought to perform.<br /> <br /> So why wouldn't White Wolf, Onyx Path--<i>whomever</i>--set up their own similar service. I would pay real world money every month for access to such a resource. White Wolf could literally re-host the Reference Desk itself under its own banner, and I would <i>probably </i>(cause I never used it because that would have been wrong) pay them an indeterminate amount of money per month for access thereto.<br /> <br /> I gotta tell you, hunting down information across two dozen different books is a pain the ass. I mean, I know we're not supposed to care about powerz or mechanics... but some of us sometimes like to know how a thing is written before applying it, but we don't exactly remember the exact wording describing how some eldritch power is supposed to function. And it would be nice to have one place to go to for all that stuff.<br /> <br /> I can't possibly be alone in this desire (and willingness to pay for the pleasure of not having to look through a dozen books when some esoteric power happens to come up).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T16:14:21-07:00","id":1242810,"title":"","content":"I'd be down to pay for that, especially if it was well organized. The books are a pain in the ass to sort through. Make it happen, OP! We're lining up to give you money for it. A whole two people deep line so far!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T16:34:12-07:00","id":1242816,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path can't make it happen, at least for the WoD games, because it's not their call. It's on White Wolf now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T12:15:44-07:00","id":1243880,"title":"","content":"WWP has this: <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/store/item/203/WoD_Book_Subscription\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.worldofdarkness.com/stor...k_Subscription</a> which gives you access to digital versions of A LOT of their pre-20th anniversary editions of their games. It's not a nice, searchable database of powers and such, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T22:29:56-07:00","id":1244385,"title":"","content":"If I were starting out, or we didn't have two physical copies of nearly every book; the subscription looks great.<br /> <br /> We did use Reference desk a lot. We had the books, but it was just so much more useful to bring up for a quick rules dispute on the powers. Compared to searching through a dozen books to find the right power we were talking about.<br /> I think something like that with a small subscription fee could be very successful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16927-illithid","name":"Illithid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16927_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T04:22:00-07:00","id":1244442,"title":"","content":"I have a feeling that that problem will sooner or later be solved through the Storyteller Vault, and books that people write up that collect a type of information from across books in exactly such formats. Bonus: You don't need to be online, and it's one-off fees rather than subscriptions. The con is of course, that volunteers need to write the stuff up and gather it, even if they get compensated through the purchase.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T16:08:28-07:00","id":1244961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1230736-why-can-t-ww-op-or-someone-make-a-subscription-site-like-the-reference-desk?p=1244442#post1244442\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The con is of course, that volunteers need to write the stuff up and gather it, even if they get compensated through the purchase.</div> </div> </div> </div>What kills me is that someone (like whomever made the Ref Desk) gave of themselves, seemingly with no profit motive, to make that site. In other words, there are people out there who just want this to exist and take nothing for themselves! How hard is it really to harness that desire and just allow it to benefit the community that gave rise to it?<br /> <br /> The value of these books, for me and likely others, is not just the powerz, but the story and the mythos. I get get it! But you're <i>probably</i> not effectively going to condense the mythos into a satisfying short-version of itself. But at least the raw mechanics of the thing can be easily accessed, no?<br /> <br /> Far be it for me to tell anyone how to use their intellectual property, but hell, dude, it's not like I'm paying these people anything monthly... but I WOULD--and I can't be alone here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-11T17:52:18-07:00","id":1244994,"title":"","content":"It's worth remembering (as to 'harnessing desire') that in IP law there is a concept of the need to defend. If you know about a copyright violation, and do nothing about it (even if you're not really bothered by it) you weaken your case against suits in the future when someone does something you don't like. It's stupid, but it's reality for these companies.<br /> <br /> And I know that for those of us that would pay for access it can be frustrating, but I just don't think there's as many of us as it seems. It's especially weird to put the transition between fan efforts which are done for free, and official efforts which are important to do under contract for pay (it helps protect both sides), in the context of how much it really costs, and thus how many users you'd really need to consistently be paying for the service.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}